<h3 id="how-to-obtain-transcripts-if-the-school-is-closed">How to Obtain Transcripts if the School is Closed</h3>

<p>If your school has closed, don’t worry! Many closed institutions transfer their records to the <strong>state’s department of education</strong> or other designated archives. 
You can contact the state education office where your school was located, or search online archives that specialize in closed schools’ records.</p>

