<h2 id="what-happens-if-youve-been-out-of-school-for-a-long-time">What Happens if You’ve Been Out of School for a Long Time?</h2>

<p>If you graduated a while ago, you might wonder if your records are still accessible.</p>

<p>Schools maintain records for many years, but it’s a good idea to check with your institution. Older records may take longer to retrieve, especially if they’re stored in archived systems.</p>

